/Title (At Hustle Hive Learning, we deliver a broad, balanced and engaging curriculum designed around the individual needs of each learner. Our approach combines academic development with practical, creative and real-world experiences that help young people build confidence, resilience, independence and the skills needed for their next steps. )
>>
endobj

910 0 obj
<<
/Dest [ 17 0 R /XYZ 47.000004 578 0 ]
/Next 911 0 R
/Parent 79 0 R
/Prev 909 0 R
/SE 415 0 R
/Title (Learning is purposeful and personalised. Literacy, numeracy, communication and problem-solving are developed through meaningful projects and practical activities rather than taught in isolation. Learners have opportunities to design, make, create, explore, collaborate and develop ideas while building positive attitudes towards learning. )
>>
endobj

