/Title (Learners follow a personalised pathway through the Hustle 100 according to their individual needs, interests, placement objectives and length of placement. They are not expected to complete all 100 elements. Instead, activities are selected to provide meaningful experiences, achievable challenges and opportunities to demonstrate progress. )
>>
